    },
    {
      "t": 40.8,
      "text": "The artifact says so too, right at the top."
    },
    {
      "t": 46.8,
      "text": "And kiln is holding the chain, both ends of it."
    },
    {
      "t": 50.8,
      "text": "The batch you fired goes in the description. Prepare again, then fire."
    }
